window.ANAKIN_CHAPTERS = [{"num": "01", "title": "Mission Brief", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">This builds <span class=\"accent\">Anakin Skywalker</span> three ways — Episode III robes, Clone Wars, and the Ahsoka flashback look. Pick a look with the toggle above the Forge; the full PDF covers all three.</p>\n   <p>Episode III is all <b>cloth, leather, and a blue blade</b> — no printing, doable in a weekend. The Clone Wars and Ahsoka looks add 3D-printed armour (pauldron, gauntlets, chest plate). Same robe base, blue blade for all three.</p>\n   <h3>The Big Idea</h3>\n   <ul><li>Jedi = <b>Rebel Legion</b> (heroes). Villains = 501st.</li>\n   <li>Mostly buy or sew. The only \"hard\" part is the saber — and you can buy that.</li>\n   <li>Blade is <b>blue</b>.</li></ul>"}, {"num": "02", "title": "Procurement Roster", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Three paths: <span class=\"accent\">(A)</span> buy a full set, <span class=\"accent\">(B)</span> buy pieces, <span class=\"accent\">(C)</span> sew it. Most do B.</p>\n   <h3>Path A · Buy the Whole Set</h3><p>Full \"Anakin ROTS Jedi\" costumes ship from China for about <b>€42–60</b>. Costume-grade, great for a first Halloween.</p>\n   <h3>Path B · Taobao Pieces</h3><ul>\n   <li>Tunic — 绝地武士 服装 棉麻 棕色</li><li>Robe — 绝地武士 斗篷 连帽 棕色</li>\n   <li>Belt — 绝地 腰带 真皮 棕色</li><li>Boots — 棕色 高筒靴</li><li>Glove (1) — 黑色 皮手套 单只</li></ul>\n   <h3>Path C · Sew It</h3><p>Deep-brown cotton/linen + a free Jedi tunic pattern. Most accurate, most work.</p>"}, {"num": "03", "title": "Robes & Tunic", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Layered right, even cheap pieces read \"Jedi\" instantly.</p>\n   <h3>Layer Order (skin → out)</h3>\n   <ul><li>1 · Under-tunic (cream)</li><li>2 · Outer tunic (deep brown, crosses over)</li>\n   <li>3 · Tabards (long panels, front & back)</li><li>4 · Obi / sash</li>\n   <li>5 · Belt over the obi</li><li>6 · Robe on top</li></ul>\n   <div class=\"reader-callout\"><div class=\"label\">▌ ROBE LENGTH</div>Hem ~5 cm off the floor — long, but won't catch on stairs.</div>"}, {"num": "04", "title": "The Lightsaber", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Anakin's blade is <span class=\"accent\">blue</span>. Four ways to get one.</p>\n   <div class=\"reader-callout\"><div class=\"label\">▌ THE EASY ANSWER</div>A blue neopixel saber is the simplest option. Already own a saber? Just set it to BLUE — one saber covers every look.</div>\n   <h3>The Paths</h3><ul>\n   <li><b>A · Print a hilt</b> — CaseStudyno8 (1538383) or infinati (321812).</li>\n   <li><b>B · Cheap LED saber</b> — Taobao 光剑 蓝色, €40–120.</li>\n   <li><b>C · Neopixel</b> — bright blue, sound, clash. Best value.</li>\n   <li><b>D · Premium</b> — screen-accurate metal hilt, €100–400+.</li></ul>\n   <p>Approval: metal hilt, blue blade, one silver + one copper button, Graflex emitter, covertec wheel.</p>"}, {"num": "05", "title": "The Glove & Hero Details", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">The touches that say \"Anakin,\" not \"a Jedi.\"</p>\n   <div class=\"reader-callout\"><div class=\"label\">▌ ONE GLOVE</div>Black leather glove on the RIGHT hand only — the mechno-hand. Left hand bare.</div>\n   <h3>Scar & Hair</h3><ul><li>Thin scar over the <b>right eye</b> — subtle line, not a gash.</li>\n   <li>Shoulder-length hair swept back; clean-shaven for ROTS.</li></ul>"}, {"num": "06", "title": "Build Sequence", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Fast, because there's nothing to print or paint.</p>\n   <ul><li><b>1 · Order</b> tunic, robe, belt, boots, saber (or set any saber you own to blue). Order early.</li>\n   <li><b>2 · Fit & hem</b> robe to ~5 cm off floor; sleeves to the wrist.</li>\n   <li><b>3 · Layer & belt</b> — practice the order; obi + belt snug.</li>\n   <li><b>4 · Details</b> — glove, scar, hair. Light the blade blue. Done.</li></ul>\n   <div class=\"reader-callout\"><div class=\"label\">▌ 90-MINUTE RULE</div>Do a full 90-minute test wear at home first.</div>"}, {"num": "07", "title": "Game Day", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Robes are warm — great for a cold Halloween.</p>\n   <ul><li>Saber charged and BLUE; robe hemmed; glove on the right hand.</li>\n   <li>Kit: safety pins (tabards slip), spare glove, blade batteries.</li>\n   <li>Watch the hem on stairs. Take the robe off between photos indoors to stay cool.</li></ul>"}, {"num": "08", "title": "Builder Tips", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\"><i>\"A Jedi's strength flows from a belt that actually stays up.\"</i></p>\n   <ul><li>Obi + belt hold everything together — get them snug.</li>\n   <li>One glove, right hand only.</li>\n   <li>Blue, not red — double-check before you leave.</li>\n   <li>Keep boots and belt the same brown family.</li></ul>"}, {"num": "09", "title": "Variant Reference", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Pick an era before you build.</p>\n   <ul><li><b>Ep I</b> — kid, simple tan tunic. Easiest.</li>\n   <li><b>Ep II</b> — Padawan braid, dark tunic.</li>\n   <li><b>Ep III</b> — full Knight: robes, tabards, right glove, scar, blue blade. No armour.</li>\n   <li><b>Clone Wars</b> — darker robes + printed pauldron & gauntlets.</li>\n   <li><b>Ahsoka</b> — navy/maroon + pauldron, gauntlets & chest plate.</li></ul>\n   <div class=\"reader-callout\"><div class=\"label\">▌ NO BRAID</div>Ep III Anakin is a Knight — no Padawan braid.</div>"}, {"num": "10", "title": "Glossary", "body": "\n   <ul><li><b>Rebel Legion</b> — heroes' costume club (Jedi/rebels).</li>\n   <li><b>Tunic</b> — the cross-over robe-shirt.</li><li><b>Tabard</b> — front/back hanging panels.</li>\n   <li><b>Obi</b> — wide waist sash.</li><li><b>Covertec wheel</b> — disc that clips the hilt to the belt.</li>\n   <li><b>Mechno-hand</b> — Anakin's robot right hand (→ the single glove).</li>\n   <li><b>Neopixel</b> — bright LED blade with sound.</li></ul>"}, {"num": "11", "title": "Why Build", "body": "\n   <p class=\"lead\">Because before the mask, he was the hero everyone watched.</p>\n   <p>Vader is the hard-mode build — armour, paint, weeks of sanding. Anakin is the fabric-and-saber build you can finish in a weekend and grow into for years. Build one, or both, and switch sides with a button.</p>\n   <p class=\"accent\">May the Force be with you. Always.</p>"}];
